nWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":39606,"initDialog":3960601,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[39608],"npcId":[1001],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/AQ/Mengde3_396/Q39606","priority":5,"questId":396,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":3960601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":257970083,"text":"木々のすき間から流れる風は心地よく、ボクの好きな匂いがする…","nextNodeIds":[3960602]},{"nodeId":3960602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2224885227,"text":"ハハッ、前回のボクも同じようなこと言ってたよね。はぁ、なんでこのセリフを言う時は、いつもツイてない時なんだろう？","nextNodeIds":[3960603]},{"nodeId":3960603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3308905299,"text":"それで…「神の心」って何？","nextNodeIds":[3960604]},{"nodeId":3960604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3736754803,"text":"…気付かれてたか。","nextNodeIds":[3960605]},{"nodeId":3960605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1441633987,"text":"はぁ…一般人に話せる内容じゃないんだけどね。でも、君にならこっそり教えてもいいかな。","nextNodeIds":[3960606]},{"nodeId":3960606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2084448259,"text":"君も知ってると思うけど、「神の目」はごく僅かな人しか持てない外付けの魔力器官だ。それを持つ者たちは「神の目」を通して元素力を導いている。","nextNodeIds":[3960607]},{"nodeId":3960607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2005680003,"text":"実はね、「神の目」の所有者はみんな、神になる資格を持っているんだよ。その者たちは「原神」と呼ばれて、天空の島に登る資格があるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3960608]},{"nodeId":3960608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":33045915,"text":"「原神」？聞いたことがない言葉だな…","nextNodeIds":[3960609]},{"nodeId":3960609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":273451339,"text":"フフン、それは本当の神しか知らない秘密だからね。とにかく、ボクたちは「神の目」という初歩的な器官はいらないんだ——","nextNodeIds":[3960610]},{"nodeId":3960610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1071030499,"text":"その代わり、神の魔力器官は天空の島と共鳴してつながっている…それが「神の心」だよ。","nextNodeIds":[3960611]},{"nodeId":3960611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2256359659,"text":"ウェンティの腰にあるのは？","nextNodeIds":[3960612]},{"nodeId":3960612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1422831251,"text":"えへっ、ただの光るガラス玉だよ、不要な疑いを避けるためのね。","nextNodeIds":[3960613,3960614]},{"nodeId":3960613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3116815747,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[3960615]},{"nodeId":3960615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2295537507,"text":"じゃあさ、さっき会ってすぐオイラを吹っ飛ばして、ウェンティの「神の心」を奪った悪い女は一体誰だ…？","nextNodeIds":[3960616]},{"nodeId":3960616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2995131011,"text":"彼女は「シニョーラ」——ファデュイ十一人の執行官の第8位、コードネーム「淑女」だよ。","nextNodeIds":[3960617]},{"nodeId":3960617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1359471451,"text":"ファデュイの執行官はみんな彼女のように、スネージナヤの女皇によって神のような権力を与えられ、凡人を超えた力を手に入れた。","nextNodeIds":[3960618]},{"nodeId":3960618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2213228571,"text":"スネージナヤの…女皇？それって…","nextNodeIds":[3960619]},{"nodeId":3960619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2647872107,"text":"うん、七神の一柱、スネージナヤパレスに鎮座する「氷の女皇」、ファトゥス全員が忠誠を誓う唯一の相手だよ。","nextNodeIds":[3960620]},{"nodeId":3960620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2433030555,"text":"七神間の関係は、全員仲が良いわけではないけど、まさか彼女が他の神から「神の心」を奪おうとするとは…","nextNodeIds":[3960621]},{"nodeId":3960621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":756791003,"text":"氷の女皇はどんな神？","nextNodeIds":[3960622]},{"nodeId":3960622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1554107563,"text":"ああ…何て言えばいいかな？","nextNodeIds":[3960623]},{"nodeId":3960623,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3070740659,"text":"「500年前の彼女」をボクは知ってるけど、「今の彼女」はよく知らないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3960624]},{"nodeId":3960624,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3520011371,"text":"500年前のとある大きな災害の後、彼女はボクとのつながりを全て断ったからね…","nextNodeIds":[3960625]},{"nodeId":3960625,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3840290315,"text":"でも、氷の神とファデュイのことは、あとでまた話すよ。","nextNodeIds":[3960626]},{"nodeId":3960626,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1162544315,"text":"#七神を全員探すとなると、{NICKNAME}の旅はおそらく困難に満ちることだろう。","nextNodeIds":[3960627]},{"nodeId":3960627,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3833962491,"text":"まずはモンドの隣国に行くといい——あそこの「岩」の神はボクと違って、自ら「璃月」全域を治めてるから。","nextNodeIds":[3960628]},{"nodeId":3960628,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1230037003,"text":"彼は年に一度だけ公の場に降臨して神託を下し、璃月の新たな1年の経営方針を民に伝えるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3960629]},{"nodeId":3960629,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":597997035,"text":"それでも、その仕事の頻度は誰かさんより上だな。","nextNodeIds":[3960630]},{"nodeId":3960630,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1269554971,"text":"えへっ？","nextNodeIds":[3960631]},{"nodeId":3960631,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3355777027,"text":"…とにかく、今年の「迎仙儀式」はもうすぐ始まるみたいだ。うん、逃したらまた1年待つことになる。","nextNodeIds":[3960632]},{"nodeId":3960632,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2218158091,"text":"#は！？そんな大事なことをなんで早く言わないんだよ？じゃあな、{NICKNAME}、早く行こう——","nextNodeIds":[3960633]},{"nodeId":3960633,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3382984587,"text":"待って、「風を捕まえる異邦人」。","nextNodeIds":[3960634,3960636]},{"nodeId":3960634,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2440188707,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}？","nextNodeIds":[3960635]},{"nodeId":3960635,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":940088811,"text":"そうだよ。","nextNodeIds":[3960638]},{"nodeId":3960638,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3187351811,"text":"旅人…君が再び旅に出た時、旅そのものの意味を忘れないでほしい。","nextNodeIds":[3960639]},{"nodeId":3960639,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3749165891,"text":"テイワットの鳥、歌と城、女皇、ファデュイと魔物…みんな君の旅の一部だ。","nextNodeIds":[3960640]},{"nodeId":3960640,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1730673771,"text":"終点は全てを意味するわけではない。終点に辿り着く前、君の目でこの世界を観察するといい…","nextNodeIds":[3960641,3960642]},{"nodeId":3960641,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2574036699,"text":"ウェンティ…","nextNodeIds":[3960643]},{"nodeId":3960643,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2458474731,"text":"うん！風神の忠告はここまで！ここから先はウェンティの時間だ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":3960642,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":191592027,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[3960643]},{"nodeId":3960636,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":567117507,"text":"ごめん、勝手に七天神像の風を借りた…","nextNodeIds":[3960637]},{"nodeId":3960637,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1690223019,"text":"ハハッ、ありがたく使っておくれ——ボクに蒲公英酒を奢ってくれたら尚更いいけど。","nextNodeIds":[3960638]},{"nodeId":3960614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1295066411,"text":"また騙された、もう慣れてるけど。","nextNodeIds":[3960615]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[39608,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":